    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365110/extras/7ece3079e95b104f4301fd28ae76c033.avif?t=1704239218\" /></span><br><br><strong>Text Twist 3 Word Game</strong><br><br>The unique and most famous word game of all time is back!<br><br>Featuring:<br><br>\u2022 Over 1000 Different levels to play.<br>\u2022 Complete dictionaries and thousands of levels for English, German, Italian, Russian, Portuguese, Swedish, Spanish, Turkish, Dutch, and, French languages.<br>\u2022 Support levels containing 3-6 letters.<br>\u2022 Simple swipe and type system.<br>\u2022 Great interface with Tips support. Awesome Soundtrack.<br>\u2022 Easy to play. You can use your touch screen or a mouse to play the game. No need to type the letters.<br><br>Enjoy this brand-new version of the classic Text Twist 3 now!",
